flowchart TD
  A[Org Admin opens /settings/portfolio] --> B[Select profile template<br/>small / enterprise / government]
  B --> C[Load PORTFOLIO_POLICY_PRESETS]
  C --> D[Customize stages, required fields,<br/>finance thresholds, relationship types]
  D --> E{validatePolicyConfig}
  E -->|invalid| F[Block activate/save<br/>show errors]
  F --> D
  E -->|valid| G[Preview impact<br/>required fields / approvals / locks]
  G --> H{Admin confirms save}
  H -->|cancel| D
  H -->|confirm| I[updateOrganizationPortfolioPolicy]
  I --> J[Persist OrgPortfolioPolicy on Organization<br/>bump version if stages/mode change]
  J --> K[Optional alsoSetClientType<br/>sync modulesForClientType]
  K --> L[New portfolio submit/resubmit<br/>uses normalizePortfolioPolicy]
  L --> M[applyWorkflowAction with policy]
  N[In-progress portfolios] -.->|not silently rewritten| O[Keep status + history<br/>audit notes policy version on next action]
  J -.-> N
